    <h1>Meeting Minutes of 2026/5/25</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p local-id=3D"fc86890571a3">Hi all,</p>
<p local-id=3D"8ca7b075881c">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"f0c59c7be3fb">Thank you so much for your attendance. Please =
kindly check the meeting minutes below for the meeting.</p>
<p local-id=3D"5557761bda70">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"980335701938">Date: Monday, 25<sup>th</sup>&nbsp;May, 2026</=
p>
<p local-id=3D"a817d298eace">Time: 17:30 HK time</p>
<p local-id=3D"ad29ca200830">Attendees: Vincent Liang, Tao Huang, Loura Guo=
, Jiajin Zhong, Daijiang Xie, Yixi Wang, Suijie Song, Guangyuan Mu, Huifang=
 Liu, Jiaxing Dai, Shu Cheng</p>
<p local-id=3D"6ddde964bd16"></p>
<p local-id=3D"57588acc8509"><strong>Quick Recap</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"73b3fab8b1ab">This meeting is the third meeting of the =E6=
=B1=87=E4=B8=B0=E7=A7=91=E6=8A=80=E8=8F=81=E8=8B=B1=E8=AE=AD=E7=BB=83=E8=90=
=A5&nbsp;=E2=80=93 AI=E6=99=BA=E8=83=BD=E9=97=AE=E7=AD=94=E5=8A=A9=E6=89=8B=
.&nbsp; In this meeting, Yixi shared some cutting-edge AI knowledge with us=
. The team then discussed the plan and identified the necessary functions t=
hat the Q&amp;A system must have for the first checkpoint.</p>
<p local-id=3D"b30a28e23c0a"></p>
<p local-id=3D"05bf31f13743"><strong>Discussion Summary</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"d73e97db-dc7c-48bd-b999-1b0e1f27007c">
<li local-id=3D"3547d6ae-360d-4cbb-ab15-b13f72ed05ef">
<p local-id=3D"e507a4c878cc">Yixi used an article <em>teaching claude why <=
/em>to underline the importance of making model understand why it should be=
have like this.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1e90369c-19c3-436f-af3e-69a37b66a434">
<p local-id=3D"4aed968dba91">The team agreed to simplified present plan and=
 reached a consensus on the essential functions: user layer, agent layer(to=
ols set), data persistence layer(vector storage, document storage, metadata=
 storage) and data processing pipeline.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5bac87b8-968c-4760-9bd5-c7ee8e56ac5a">
<p local-id=3D"2d12de9f4b37">The team agreed to divide the labor according =
to individual technology stack.</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"be40223e298c"></p>
<p local-id=3D"ff65508f68c4"><strong>Action Items:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"5f846d18-dc50-44db-9a29-4232cec8ff60">
<li local-id=3D"a6a004e1-26f5-4e55-ba2e-d679a05a7e74">
<p local-id=3D"6b9c94270d62"><strong>All team members:</strong>&nbsp;Select=
ing the part according to your interest and ability.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a6554e8d-ad9b-4d8c-a2cf-5f119542c053">
<p local-id=3D"9160ca19407f">Jiajin Zhong will share the AI knowledge with =
us. Please get prepared.</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"a378144e5e37"></p>
<p local-id=3D"8f67c6a74250">Hi Jiajin and Daijiang,</p>
<p local-id=3D"f15608f2d992">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"16d6dd3ef6c0">Kindly remind you that Jiajin will be the host=
 and Daijiang will be the MoM Noter of next weekly meeting. Please read abo=
ve Notes and get prepard.</p>
<p local-id=3D"cf0c135866a9"></p>
<p local-id=3D"377718be9f48">Kind regards,</p>
<p local-id=3D"f65274ec4e29"></p>
<p local-id=3D"6fcc96db7da0">Jiajin Zhong</p>
<p local-id=3D"35fcae4941b6"></p>
<p local-id=3D"f8ffaaf8d1e6"></p>
<p local-id=3D"ded508dbf104"></p>
    </div>
